============================================================
🔐 STREETGUARD: BURGLARY PREDICTION & PATROL OPTIMIZATION
============================================================

StreetGuard is a comprehensive toolkit for forecasting burglary 
hotspots and generating optimized police patrol routes in London.

It includes:

- Web-based scheduling tool for crime prediction and visualization
- Scripts for data preprocessing and crime analytics
- Route optimization algorithms for patrol planning
- Real-world crime datasets (focused on burglaries in London)
- Time-slot allocation for police officers
- Special operations mode for large-scale deployments

------------------------------------------------------------
🌐 WEBSITE / DEMO
------------------------------------------------------------

Visit: https://streetguard.info/presentation

------------------------------------------------------------
FEATURES
------------------------------------------------------------

📅 Interactive Scheduler
    - Visualize patrol routes and assign officers by time slots.

📊 Crime Prediction Engine
    - Forecasts high-risk areas using historical burglary data.

🧠 Route Optimization
    - Generates efficient patrol paths using algorithms.

📁 Crime Datasets
    - Cleaned and structured burglary records from London.

🛠️ Modular Scripts
    - Preprocessing, modeling, and route calculation.

🎯 Special Operations Mode
    - Deploy additional resources during proposed crime spikes.

------------------------------------------------------------
ACKNOWLEDGMENTS
------------------------------------------------------------

- London Metropolitan Police for open data access.
- Communities can contribute to the tool for the special operations.
- Conclusions and results are only advisory.
